+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
+/*
+ * Copyright (c) 2018 Oleg Ivanov <balbes-150@yandex.ru>
+ * Copyright (c) 2018 Martin Blumenstingl <martin.blumenstingl@googlemail.com>
